                                "sense_id": "2a9d35ee-0287-3bb5-bc10-c4177068ac3a",
                                "text": "As for Mars, as he is neerer to the Sunne, so feeleth he the Sunne beames by a quadrant aspect, to wit, ninetie degrees: wherupon that motion tooke the name, called the first and second Nonagenarie, from both risings."
